S(4, "v1 to v5, with their commits, hashes, reviews and issues (#5914 to #5925, #5940 to #5964, #5969 to #5988, #5996 to #6014, #6017 to #6029), are listed in the headers of v4, v5 and v6.",
  "v1 to v6, with their commits, hashes, reviews and issues (#5914 to #5925, #5940 to #5964, #5969 to #5988, #5996 to #6014, #6017 to #6029, #6032 to #6045), are listed in the headers of v4, v5, v6 and v7.")
